# Bandit SAST for Python services in CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml).
#
# Why [sarif]: github/codeql-action/upload-sarif requires SARIF. Bandit 1.8.x
# ships csv/json/txt only; -f sarif needs the optional extra (jschema-to-python,
# sarif-om, jsonpickle, attrs).
#
# Alternatives: bandit -f json + custom converter (extra CI code, drift risk);
# skip Code Scanning upload (weaker GH security tab). Rejected.
#
# Security: CI-only, hash-pinned in bandit.txt, --only-binary :all:. Extra
# packages do not ship in embedder runtime. Scan scope is services/*/app.
#
# Maintenance: PyCQA/bandit; extra adds ~4 small PyPI pkgs. Bump via
# pip-compile --generate-hashes when refreshing bandit.txt.
bandit[sarif]==1.9.4
